{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s51-p01",
      "text": "A zero-waste life is a lifestyle that hardly creates any rubbish.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p02",
      "text": "Zero waste was first suggested by a French woman called B. Johnson.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p03",
      "text": "Her idea is to live a life and try not to create any rubbish.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p04-01",
      "text": "Use different kinds of ways to save the environment,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p04-02",
      "text": "such as stopping the use of one-off objects,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p04-03",
      "text": "giving unwanted things to others or donating these things to organisations like the Red Cross.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p05",
      "text": "A zero-waste life follows the 6R rule—Refuse, Reduce, Reuse, Repair, Recycle and Rot.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p06",
      "text": "Chen Yuan, 27, is deeply interested in this idea.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p07",
      "text": "She and her boyfriend Joe have lived in Beijing for many years.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p08-01",
      "text": "Over August-October when Chen followed the rule of zero waste 6R,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p08-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p08-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p08-02",
      "text": "she and her boyfriend both produced only two cans of rubbish.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p08-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p08-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p09-01",
      "text": "Now the couple have opened a small shop in Beijing,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p09-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p09-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p09-02",
      "text": "where they use wood products to take the place of plastic ones and cloth bags printed with environmental logos.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p09-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p09-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p10",
      "text": "The store also has second-hand books and CDs to make the best of the used things.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p11",
      "text": "The zero-waste lifestyle is not for ascetics. It is just around us.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p12",
      "text": "Chen is devoting herself to the zero-waste lifestyle.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s51-p13",
      "text": "She expects some of her friends to join her on the road to zero waste.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p13.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
